### Execute a discovered MCP tool
# Replace the UUID with the id returned by POST /connect-ai/api/tools
POST http://localhost:8080/connect-ai/api/tools/8c1a5f2e-3e4a-4f8b-9c10-2b5a6d7e8f90/tools/create_issue/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "arguments": {
    "title": "Payment failure",
    "description": "Investigate payment failure after release 2.4.1"
  }
}

### Execute a tool with no arguments
# The request body can be omitted when the MCP tool accepts no arguments.
POST http://localhost:8080/connect-ai/api/tools/8c1a5f2e-3e4a-4f8b-9c10-2b5a6d7e8f90/tools/health_check/execute
